msgstr "Use Sandbox (UAT) for testing, Production for your live website."

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:228
msgid "Production (thật)"
msgstr "Production (Live)"

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:229
msgid "Sandbox / UAT (test)"
msgstr "Sandbox / UAT (Test)"

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:234
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "Client ID"

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:236
msgid ""
"Mã định danh đối tác do Tingee cung cấp. Header x-client-id trong mọi API "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Partner identifier provided by Tingee. Used as the x-client-id header in all API "
"requests."

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:243
msgid "Secret Token"
msgstr "Secret Token"

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:245
msgid "Khóa bí mật để sinh chữ ký HMAC-SHA512. Không chia sẻ cho bất kỳ ai."
msgstr "Secret key used to generate HMAC-SHA512 signatures. Do not share with anyone."

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:251
msgid "Số tài khoản VA nhận tiền"
msgstr "Receiving VA Account Number"

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:253
msgid ""
"Số tài khoản ảo (Virtual Account — vaAccountNumber) của merchant trên "
"Tingee. Dùng để hiển thị QR cho khách và nhận thanh toán. Lấy trong mục quản "
"lý tài khoản tại app.tingee.vn."
msgstr ""
"Your merchant Virtual Account number (vaAccountNumber) on Tingee. Used to display "
"the QR code and receive payments. Find it in the account management section at app.tingee.vn."

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:260
msgid "Mã BIN ngân hàng (bankBin)"
msgstr "Bank BIN Code (bankBin)"

#. translators: examples of Vietnamese bank BIN codes
#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:263
msgid ""
"Mã BIN của ngân hàng liên kết với tài khoản VA ở trên — bắt buộc để sinh QR "
"động. Xem danh sách BIN trong tài liệu Tingee. Ví dụ: <code>970422</code> "
"(MB Bank), <code>970436</code> (Vietcombank), <code>970415</code> "
"(VietinBank)."
msgstr ""
"BIN code of the bank linked to the VA account above — required to generate dynamic QR. "
"See the BIN list in the Tingee documentation. Examples: <code>970422</code> "
"(MB Bank), <code>970436</code> (Vietcombank), <code>970415</code> "
"(VietinBank)."

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:274
msgid "Webhook IPN"
msgstr "Webhook IPN"

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:276
msgid ""
"Tingee sẽ gửi thông báo thanh toán về URL bên dưới. Hãy copy và điền vào "
"trang Developers của Tingee."
msgstr ""
"Tingee will send payment notifications to the URL below. Copy it and paste into "
"the Tingee Developers page."

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:280 includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:386
msgid "URL Webhook"
msgstr "Webhook URL"

#: includes/class-tingee-gateway.php:290
